{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"rlh_jt5_guk","canonical_person_id":"rlh_jt5_guk","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["rlh_jt5_guk"],"persons":[{"id":"rlh_jt5_guk","label":"沒骨能〔與馬隆同討樹機能〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"沒骨能","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long","quote":"沒骨能"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"沒骨能〔與馬隆同討樹機能〕，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-057-ma-long-ws2413329","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-057-ma-long-ws2413329"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002:m0625","surface":"沒骨能","start":625,"end":628,"person_id":"rlh_jt5_guk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-057-ma-long:p002","text":"初，涼州刺史楊欣失羌戎之和，隆陳其必敗。俄而欣為虜所沒，河西斷絕，帝每有西顧之憂，臨朝而歎曰：「誰能為我討此虜通涼州者乎？」朝臣莫對。隆進曰：「陛下若能任臣，臣能平之。」帝曰：「必能滅賊，何為不任，顧卿方略何如耳。隆曰：「陛下若能任臣，當聽臣自任。」帝曰：「云何？隆曰：「臣請募勇士三千人，無問所從來，率之鼓行而西，稟陛下威德，醜虜何足滅哉！」帝許之，乃以隆為武威太守。公卿僉曰：「六軍既眾，州郡兵多，但當用之，不宜橫設賞募以亂常典。隆小將妄說，不可從也。」帝弗納。隆募限腰引弩三十六鈞、弓四鈞，立標簡試。自旦至中，得三千五百人，隆曰：「足矣。」因請自至武庫選杖。武庫令與隆忿爭，御史中丞奏劾隆，隆曰：「臣當亡命戰場，以報所受，武庫令乃以魏時朽杖見給，不可復用，非陛下使臣滅賊意也。」帝從之，又給其三年軍資。隆於是西渡溫水。虜樹機能等以眾萬計，或乘險以遏隆前，或設伏以截隆後。隆依八陣圖作偏箱車，地廣則鹿角車營，路狹則為木屋施于車上，且戰且前，弓矢所及，應弦而倒。奇謀間發，出敵不意。或夾道累磁石，賊負鐵鎧，行不得前，隆卒悉被犀甲，無所留礙，賊咸以為神。轉戰千里，殺傷以千數。自隆之西，音問斷絕，朝廷憂之，或謂已沒。後隆使夜到，帝撫掌歡笑。詰朝，召群臣謂曰：「若從諸卿言，是無秦、涼也。」乃詔曰：「隆以偏師寡眾，奮不顧難，冒險能濟。其假節、宣威將軍，加赤幢、曲蓋、鼓吹。」隆到武威，虜大人猝跋韓、且萬能等率萬餘落歸降，前後誅殺及降附者以萬計。又率善戎沒骨能等與樹機能大戰，斬之，涼州遂平。朝議將加隆將士勳賞，有司奏隆將士皆先加顯爵，不應更授，衛將軍楊珧駁曰：「前精募將士，少加爵命者，此適所以為誘引。今隆全軍獨克，西土獲安，不得便以前授塞此後功，宜皆聽許，以明要信。」乃從珧議，賜爵加秩各有差。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":32,"last_line":32,"raw_start":1797,"raw_end":2544,"raw_character_offsets":[1797,1798,1799,1800,1801,1802,1803,1804,1805,1806,1807,1808,1809,1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838,1839,1840,1841,1842,1843,1844,1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880,1881,1882,1883,1884,1885,1886,1887,1888,1889,1890,1891,1892,1893,1894,1895,1896,1897,1898,1899,1900,19